      "message": "Is that not the default setting? The datasheet is unclear as to the defaults. Also, some GPIOs are missing from this file -- are some of those NC?\n\nIf PU / Input isn\u0027t the power-on default, maybe we should go ahead and initialize all of our GPIOs this way?",
